uct-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2><b>VSOL V1601E02-DP 2-Port EPON OLT | 10G Uplink for High-Performance Networks</b></h2><div>Enhance Your Network with the V.SOL V1601E02-DP EPON OLT – High-Speed, Scalable &amp; Reliable</div><div><br></div><div>The V.SOL V1601E02-DP 2-Port EPON OLT is a high-performance optical line terminal (OLT) designed for enterprise networks, ISPs, and large-scale FTTH deployments. Equipped with 10G uplink ports, 2 EPON ports, and high-speed RJ45/SFP interfaces, this OLT delivers exceptional network efficiency, scalability, and stability. Its compact 1U rack-mount design and low power consumption make it ideal for cost-effective fiber network expansion.</div><div><br></div><h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3><ul><li>High-Speed Connectivity – Supports 10G SFP+ uplinks for ultra-fast data transmission</li><li>Scalable EPON Network – 2 EPON ports with a 1:64 maximum splitting ratio, enabling seamless multi-user connectivity</li><li>Multiple Interfaces – 4 RJ45 ports + 2 SFP/SFP+ slots for flexible network integration</li><li>High Backplane Bandwidth – 128 Gbps backplane switching capacity ensures smooth data flow</li><li>Fast Data Processing – Port forwarding rate of 38.688 Mpps for high-speed packet transmission</li><li>Energy-Efficient Design – Low power consumption (30W) for cost-effective operation</li><li>Wide Operating Temperature Range – Functions reliably from -20°C to +60°C, perfect for diverse environments</li></ul><div><br></div><h4><b>Technical Specifications:</b></h4><ul><li>Uplink Ports: 4 x RJ45 + 2 x SFP/SFP+</li><li>EPON Ports: 2 x EPON (1:64 max splitting ratio)</li><li>Supported PON Modules: PX20, PX20+, PX20++, PX20+++, PX20++++</li><li>Backplane Bandwidth: 128 Gbps</li><li>Port Forwarding Rate: 38.688 Mpps</li><li>Power Supply: AC 100~240V, 50/60 Hz | DC -48V</li><li>Power Consumption: 30W Max</li><li>Operating Temperature: -20°C to +60°C</li><li>Storage Temperature: -40°C to +70°C</li><li>Humidity: 5% to 95% (non-condensing)</li><li>Dimensions: 442mm (L) x 200mm (W) x 43.6mm (H) (1U Rackmount Design)</li></ul><div><br></div><h4><b>What’s in the Box?</b></h4><ul><li>1x V.SOL V1601E02-DP EPON OLT</li><li>1x Power Adapter (AC/DC)</li><li>1x User Manual</li></ul><h4><b>Why Choose V.SOL V1601E02-DP EPON OLT?</b></h4><ul><li>Ideal for FTTH, ISP, and Enterprise Networks – Delivers scalable, high-performance fiber connectivity</li><li>Efficient Bandwidth Distribution – Supports 1:64 EPON splitting, allowing multiple connections with stable performance</li><li>Reliable &amp; Cost-Effective – Low power consumption, high-speed processing, and durable design</li><li>Seamless Network Expansion – 10G uplinks, SFP/SFP+ support, and multiple RJ45 ports for flexible networking</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                    \n\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-6 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-reviews\">\n                <form class=\"form-horizontal\" id=\"form-review\">\n  <div id=\"review\"><p>There are no reviews for this product.</p> </div>\n  <h4>Write a review</h4>\n        <div class=\"form-group required\">\n      <label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\" for=\"input-name\">Your Name</label>\n      <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" value=\"\" id=\"input-name\" class=\"form-control\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"form-group required\">\n      <label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\" for=\"input-review\">Your Review</label>\n      <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n        <textarea name=\"text\" rows=\"5\" id=\"input-review\" class=\"form-control\"></textarea>\n        <div class=\"help-block\"><span class=\"text-danger\">Note:</span> HTML is not translated!</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"form-group required\">\n      <label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\">Rating</label>\n\n      <div class=\"col-sm-10 rate\">\n        <span>Bad</span>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"1\">\n\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=